      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "So let's use this Riverpod package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.08,
          "end": 6.3,
          "en": "in this project here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.3,
          "end": 9.45,
          "en": "and this is the same project as before, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.45,
          "end": 12.96,
          "en": "where I installed this Riverpod package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.96,
          "end": 14.73,
          "en": "And in this lib folder here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.73,
          "end": 17.25,
          "en": "I'll add a new providers folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.25,
          "end": 19.98,
          "en": "where I wanna set up these globally available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.98,
          "end": 21.363,
          "en": "provider objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.38,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "Now in there I'll add a meals provider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 27.9,
          "en": "and I'll name this file meals_provider.dart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.9,
          "end": 29.19,
          "en": "to make it very clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.19,
          "end": 32.79,
          "en": "that this file will contain such a provider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.79,
          "end": 35.85,
          "en": "Now, in this newly added meals_provider.dart file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.85,
          "end": 38.07,
          "en": "we should start by adding an import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 42.45,
          "en": "and we should import from the flutter_riverpod package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.45,
          "end": 45.84,
          "en": "and there the flutter_riverpod.dart file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.84,
          "end": 47.463,
          "en": "So that this import is added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 52.71,
          "en": "With that import added, we can add a provider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.71,
          "end": 55.59,
          "en": "by using this provider clause that is provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.59,
          "end": 57.63,
          "en": "by flutter_riverpod.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.63,
          "end": 58.86,
          "en": "Now instantiating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.86,
          "end": 62.55,
          "en": "this provider clause will create such a provider object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.55,
          "end": 66.18,
          "en": "which we then can listen to from inside our widgets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.18,
          "end": 69.3,
          "en": "And we should, therefore, store this object in some variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.3,
          "end": 71.43,
          "en": "so that we do store this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.43,
          "end": 73.92,
          "en": "and we can access this object later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.92,
          "end": 76.28999999999999,
          "en": "So for that, I'll add a new final variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.28999999999999,
          "end": 78.18,
          "en": "called meals provider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.18,
          "end": 79.98,
          "en": "and I'll name it mealsProvider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.98,
          "end": 84.12,
          "en": "because I plan on providing my meals data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.12,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "And later, we're also going to add more complex providers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.45,
          "end": 89.133,
          "en": "but we'll keep it simple here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 93.9,
          "en": "And the provider clause then actually takes a couple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.9,
          "end": 95.78999999999999,
          "en": "of parameters, which you can set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 95.78999999999999,
          "end": 99.93,
          "en": "But most importantly, it needs at least one parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.93,
          "end": 102.03,
          "en": "one positional parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.03,
          "end": 106.02000000000001,
          "en": "and that parameter actually is of type function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.02000000000001,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "It's a function which will receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 111.33,
          "en": "a so-called ProviderRef object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.33,
          "end": 114.81,
          "en": "So a function that will receive an object automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.81,
          "end": 118.14,
          "en": "because this function, which we must pass to provider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.14,
          "end": 122.13,
          "en": "will be called by the flutter_riverpod package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.13,
          "end": 125.64,
          "en": "And this function will receive such a ref, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.64,
          "end": 127.89,
          "en": "which is of type ProviderRef.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.89,
          "end": 129.69,
          "en": "And inside of this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 129.69,
          "end": 133.41,
          "en": "we now should return the value that we wanna provide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.41,
          "end": 136.29,
          "en": "And here to keep things simple for now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.29,
          "end": 137.823,
          "en": "I'll provide my dummyMeals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.35,
          "end": 140.91,
          "en": "For that, you must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.91,
          "end": 143.64,
          "en": "that you also import dummy_data.dart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.64,
          "end": 146.96,
          "en": "And of course, providing those meals is a bit redundant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.96,
          "end": 151.59,
          "en": "because the dummyMeals is really just a list here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.59,
          "end": 154.47,
          "en": "which we could import in other files anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.47,
          "end": 157.5,
          "en": "And that is what we have been doing thus far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.5,
          "end": 161.1,
          "en": "So we don't really need to use this provider approach here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.1,
          "end": 162.66,
          "en": "We can't just import it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.66,
          "end": 164.88,
          "en": "The provider approach is more useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.88,
          "end": 169.29,
          "en": "if we have dynamic data and cross-widget state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.29,
          "end": 171.03,
          "en": "We will, of course, use that package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.03,
          "end": 173.52,
          "en": "for this more complex state later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 176.34,
          "en": "But to get started, we'll provide the dummyMeals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.34,
          "end": 178.44,
          "en": "even though it's technically not required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 179.52,
          "end": 182.37,
          "en": "But with that here, we now set up a provider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.37,
          "end": 186.21,
          "en": "And with that provider setup, we can now use it in widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.21,
          "end": 189.84,
          "en": "that need the data that is provided by this provider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.84,
          "end": 193.05,
          "en": "So in this case, we can use this provider in widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.05,
          "end": 194.97,
          "en": "that need our meals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 194.97,
          "end": 197.34,
          "en": "And in this application that would, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.34,
          "end": 199.11,
          "en": "be the tabs.dart file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 199.11,
          "end": 201.6,
          "en": "and there is the TabsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 201.6,
          "end": 203.64,
          "en": "Because in this tabs.dart file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.64,
          "end": 207.21,
          "en": "and they are in the TabsScreen state specifically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.21,
          "end": 210.39,
          "en": "I am using these dummyMeals in the build method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 210.39,
          "end": 212.61,
          "en": "to derive my available meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.61,
          "end": 215.04,
          "en": "based on the filters that were set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 215.04,
          "end": 217.65,
          "en": "Now later, we're going to outsource this logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.65,
          "end": 219.15,
          "en": "into a provider as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.15,
          "end": 221.19,
          "en": "But for the moment, I simply wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.19,
          "end": 223.65,
          "en": "that here I don't use the dummyMeals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.65,
          "end": 227.1,
          "en": "that are imported from the dummy_data.dart file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.1,
          "end": 229.56,
          "en": "but that we instead remove this import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 229.56,
